  "details": "Before the EAC update, people would use a mod called FreezeFrame to both:\n- Freeze copies of their own avatar in place\n- Record all their movements (including parameter changes and blendshapes) and play the recording back on a copy of their avatar\nThis functionality used to be incredibly useful for VR photography/cinematography, for e.g. recording poses, or acting out multiple characters with only one person. For me, taking pictures has become a lot more cumbersome without it. \nIt would be great if some similar functionality could be added in its place.",
